<title>FRANCE: Scor first half turnover rises.</title>
<headline>Scor first half turnover rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-08-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996.</p>
<p>(All figures in millions of French francs)</p>
<p>    Turnover					 6,560    vs    6,060</p>
<p>     - of which second quarter		 3,346    vs    2,970</p>
<p>NOTE - French reinsurer Scor gave the results in the official bulletin BALO.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
